%description:
Tests the error message for an invalid recording mode in @statistic.

%file: test.ned

module Node
{
    @statistic[a](record=nosuchrecorder);
}

network Test
{
    submodules:
        node: Node;
}

%inifile: test.ini
[General]
network = Test

%exitcode: 1

%contains: stderr
Cannot add statistic 'a' to module Test.node (NED type: Node): Bad recording mode 'nosuchrecorder': Result recorder "nosuchrecorder" not found
